(3654170, 510455, 76198, '<td valign="top">very nice composition and symmetry, nice color and tonal range. Maybe it would be nice to have some detail left in the sky? uncertain. Really nice, anyway.</td>', 'very nice composition and symmetry, nice color and tonal range. Maybe it would be nice to have some detail left in the sky? uncertain. Really nice, anyway.', '2007-05-16 02:46:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3654257, 512640, 67258, '<td valign="top">Well spotted - an original and very apt take on the challenge.  It is very difficult to get the exposure right when shooting directly in to the sun, but you have caught the rays and got the detail in the clouds which is the most important thing.  With a little post-processing this could be improved - a slight levels adjustment to darken the clouds even more, and cloing out the spots in the sky caused by sensor dust.</td>', 'Well spotted - an original and very apt take on the challenge.  It is very difficult to get the exposure right when shooting directly in to the sun, but you have caught the rays and got the detail in the clouds which is the most important thing.  With a little post-processing this could be improved - a slight levels adjustment to darken the clouds even more, and cloing out the spots in the sky caused by sensor dust.', '2007-05-16 03:41:34.000000', NULL, 1),
