(3656024, 512848, 78350, '<td valign="top">I think I''d have liked this better if it had just been the mirror against a background that was all pavement.</td>', 'I think I''d have liked this better if it had just been the mirror against a background that was all pavement.', '2007-05-16 13:16:21.000000', NULL, 1),
