(3656183, 512695, 58691, '<td valign="top">While I think this is an excellent shot, I dont'' think it meets the challenge. <br/> <br/>"The vanishing point is the appearance of a point on the horizon at which parallel lines converge together. Compose and photograph an interesting shot that illustrates this concept."<br/> <br/>I love the detail in the forefront and how it softens through the cityscape and into the clouds.<br/> <br/>I give it high marks on the composition, but take off some on not meeting the challenge reqs.</td>', 'While I think this is an excellent shot, I dont'' think it meets the challenge.  "The vanishing point is the appearance of a point on the horizon at which parallel lines converge together. Compose and photograph an interesting shot that illustrates this concept." I love the detail in the forefront and how it softens through the cityscape and into the clouds. I give it high marks on the composition, but take off some on not meeting the challenge reqs.', '2007-05-16 14:12:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3656184, 511272, 74953, '<td valign="top">Photo is a little blurry and the angle kind of makes you lose the vanising point on the tracks.</td>', 'Photo is a little blurry and the angle kind of makes you lose the vanising point on the tracks.', '2007-05-16 14:13:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3656187, 512411, 74953, '<td valign="top">Nicely done, and creative take on the challenge.</td>', 'Nicely done, and creative take on the challenge.', '2007-05-16 14:13:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3656192, 509630, 76198, '<td valign="top">Interesting interpretation of the challenge; nice to see something different (I did one of the interminable train-track shots). <br/> <br/>I think the lighting lets you down pretty seriously here, and ends up leaving a pretty snapshottish effect; it''s just pretty flat - I can''t tell if you used on-camera flash or (I suspect) natural lighting but either way it''s from directly behind you, so you lose the texture. The dramatic cave shots I think of tend to have several lights hidden in the foreground to accentuate the shapes in the cave.</td>', 'Interesting interpretation of the challenge; nice to see something different (I did one of the interminable train-track shots).  I think the lighting lets you down pretty seriously here, and ends up leaving a pretty snapshottish effect; it''s just pretty flat - I can''t tell if you used on-camera flash or (I suspect) natural lighting but either way it''s from directly behind you, so you lose the texture. The dramatic cave shots I think of tend to have several lights hidden in the foreground to accentuate the shapes in the cave.', '2007-05-16 14:14:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3656204, 512503, 76198, '<td valign="top">This was in the free study, wasn''t it? I remember really liking it; I think I even commented. I''ll go check after I''ve voted!<br/> <br/>Anyway, this is a very compelling space; the soft arches are wonderfully offset by the hard concrete and railings, wonderful lines and shadows. I''m not certain the image is improved by the figure being there; I almost prefer the space on it''s own - but I understand why you went with it. <br/> <br/>9.</td>', 'This was in the free study, wasn''t it? I remember really liking it; I think I even commented. I''ll go check after I''ve voted! Anyway, this is a very compelling space; the soft arches are wonderfully offset by the hard concrete and railings, wonderful lines and shadows. I''m not certain the image is improved by the figure being there; I almost prefer the space on it''s own - but I understand why you went with it.  9.', '2007-05-16 14:18:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3656206, 511057, 49166, '<td valign="top">cool shot - I use to work in that taller building.....</td>', 'cool shot - I use to work in that taller building.....', '2007-05-16 14:19:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3656216, 512677, 64853, '<td valign="top">i would have preferred it without the person but i quite like it anyway</td>', 'i would have preferred it without the person but i quite like it anyway', '2007-05-16 14:22:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3656223, 510322, 76198, '<td valign="top">Hmm... I love this pic - it''s really beautiful. But I really don''t think it meets the challenge - to me it''s not enough that some lines coverge, but that parallel lines converge as they go to infinity - that''s not what''s happening here. I expect you predicted some of these responses, though.<br/> <br/>That said, it''s really a marvelous picture; great color and DOF, and the texture of the veins is great.</td>', 'Hmm... I love this pic - it''s really beautiful. But I really don''t think it meets the challenge - to me it''s not enough that some lines coverge, but that parallel lines converge as they go to infinity - that''s not what''s happening here. I expect you predicted some of these responses, though. That said, it''s really a marvelous picture; great color and DOF, and the texture of the veins is great.', '2007-05-16 14:23:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3656229, 512749, 58691, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent image, but I don''t think it meets the challenge rules: <br/> <br/><i>The vanishing point is the appearance of a point on the horizon at which parallel lines converge together. Compose and photograph an interesting shot that illustrates this concept.</i> <br/> <br/>This will get a lower rating because of that. Great shot, though.</td>', 'This is an excellent image, but I don''t think it meets the challenge rules:  The vanishing point is the appearance of a point on the horizon at which parallel lines converge together. Compose and photograph an interesting shot that illustrates this concept.  This will get a lower rating because of that. Great shot, though.', '2007-05-16 14:25:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3656277, 512817, 72261, '<td valign="top">would be better with better dof</td>', 'would be better with better dof', '2007-05-16 14:39:01.000000', NULL, 1),
