(3658045, 512503, 33164, '<td valign="top">honestly, the picture would probably get bumped up 2 points from me by not having a person in it.  Eyes are drawn there first, then down the lines.  feels like it might also need a slight clockwise rotation. 6</td>', 'honestly, the picture would probably get bumped up 2 points from me by not having a person in it.  Eyes are drawn there first, then down the lines.  feels like it might also need a slight clockwise rotation. 6', '2007-05-16 22:30:57.000000', NULL, 1),
