(3658057, 512752, 76335, '<td valign="top">The sky doesn''t look quite right and I don''t think it meets the challenge very well, but what a wonderful composition!</td>', 'The sky doesn''t look quite right and I don''t think it meets the challenge very well, but what a wonderful composition!', '2007-05-16 22:33:01.000000', NULL, 1),
