(3658191, 512522, 78401, '<td valign="top">Very nice, excelent framing with the sign.  I might bump the contrast a bit, but not much because you don''t want to wash out the right side.  Again I thing one of the best shots using the rails.</td>', 'Very nice, excelent framing with the sign.  I might bump the contrast a bit, but not much because you don''t want to wash out the right side.  Again I thing one of the best shots using the rails.', '2007-05-16 23:13:35.000000', NULL, 1),
