(3660231, 512470, 45776, '<td valign="top">The image is a bit small, but I still like it alot. I''m a fan of very strong lines in landscapes, and the powerlines, the fence, and horizon contribute to give a very nice dynamic to the movement. It looks a little bit oversharpened though.</td>', 'The image is a bit small, but I still like it alot. I''m a fan of very strong lines in landscapes, and the powerlines, the fence, and horizon contribute to give a very nice dynamic to the movement. It looks a little bit oversharpened though.', '2007-05-17 14:13:52.000000', NULL, 1),
