(3660646, 510703, 64853, '<td valign="top">i like the border</td>', 'i like the border', '2007-05-17 16:44:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3661270, 510324, 76430, '<td valign="top">DNMC...after seeing complaints in the forum I''ll elaborate.  I see no converging lines.  Is this whiterook?  See the definition of Vanishing Point in the challenge.  It''s not fading into the fog.  Maybe you considered the fence to be it, but it''s far too far away and vague for me.</td>', 'DNMC...after seeing complaints in the forum I''ll elaborate.  I see no converging lines.  Is this whiterook?  See the definition of Vanishing Point in the challenge.  It''s not fading into the fog.  Maybe you considered the fence to be it, but it''s far too far away and vague for me.', '2007-05-17 20:14:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3661322, 512497, 76430, '<td valign="top">It looks like it might be a nice picture, but it''s much too small so see well.  I can''t tell if there is a vanishing point or not.</td>', 'It looks like it might be a nice picture, but it''s much too small so see well.  I can''t tell if there is a vanishing point or not.', '2007-05-17 20:26:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3661331, 510632, 76430, '<td valign="top">DNMC...is that little cone at the horizon the vanishing point?  OK, I''ll give you the benefit of a doubt and bump you up one point.  The lines on the ground are barely visible and don''t appear to meet at the horizon.</td>', 'DNMC...is that little cone at the horizon the vanishing point?  OK, I''ll give you the benefit of a doubt and bump you up one point.  The lines on the ground are barely visible and don''t appear to meet at the horizon.', '2007-05-17 20:27:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3661332, 511476, 76430, '<td valign="top">DNMC...I don''t see any converging lines anywhere?  Care to help me out here?</td>', 'DNMC...I don''t see any converging lines anywhere?  Care to help me out here?', '2007-05-17 20:27:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3661338, 511157, 76430, '<td valign="top">DNMC...OK, after seeing complaints about "DNMC" alone I''ll add more.  I don''t consider the tapering stalk to meet the "Vanishing Point" challenge.  With the limited light all I see besides that is the sun and the horizon.  Where is the challenge met?</td>', 'DNMC...OK, after seeing complaints about "DNMC" alone I''ll add more.  I don''t consider the tapering stalk to meet the "Vanishing Point" challenge.  With the limited light all I see besides that is the sun and the horizon.  Where is the challenge met?', '2007-05-17 20:28:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3661340, 511009, 76430, '<td valign="top">Is this a line of wall anchors?  I''d like to see a longer line with more in focus.</td>', 'Is this a line of wall anchors?  I''d like to see a longer line with more in focus.', '2007-05-17 20:28:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3661342, 510460, 76430, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, but where is the vanishing point?</td>', 'Nice picture, but where is the vanishing point?', '2007-05-17 20:28:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3661343, 510457, 76430, '<td valign="top">The two men block the vanishing point and they are out of focus.  I think it would have been better without them.</td>', 'The two men block the vanishing point and they are out of focus.  I think it would have been better without them.', '2007-05-17 20:28:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3661367, 511221, 42013, '<td valign="top">I like the picture but it is one where a perfectly symetrical framing would have worked well. Even cropping a touch off of the RH side would have helped IMO.</td>', 'I like the picture but it is one where a perfectly symetrical framing would have worked well. Even cropping a touch off of the RH side would have helped IMO.', '2007-05-17 20:34:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3661375, 510426, 42013, '<td valign="top">seems oddly unbalanced with the ''stop'' lettering in the picture. Not bad/wrong just a little off-kilter.</td>', 'seems oddly unbalanced with the ''stop'' lettering in the picture. Not bad/wrong just a little off-kilter.', '2007-05-17 20:37:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3661387, 512447, 42013, '<td valign="top">A bit soft in focus to my vision.</td>', 'A bit soft in focus to my vision.', '2007-05-17 20:39:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3661406, 511920, 42013, '<td valign="top">Much potential here. Your cropping and composition is very nice although i think losing a little from the bottom would have strengthened your compostion. The shadows and repeating forms are special and the light is a perfect angular form to contrast with the curves. The image also seems to be lacking a touch of contrast IMHO.<br/> <br/>I almost forgot... lose the grey border. :)</td>', 'Much potential here. Your cropping and composition is very nice although i think losing a little from the bottom would have strengthened your compostion. The shadows and repeating forms are special and the light is a perfect angular form to contrast with the curves. The image also seems to be lacking a touch of contrast IMHO. I almost forgot... lose the grey border. :)', '2007-05-17 20:43:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3661485, 512153, 12998, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture</td>', 'Very nice picture', '2007-05-17 21:06:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3661490, 512470, 55482, '<td valign="top">Nice contrasting colors</td>', 'Nice contrasting colors', '2007-05-17 21:07:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3661494, 511622, 12998, '<td valign="top">Could have been a very dramatic shot if the sun was coming up behind the building.  Nice picture though.</td>', 'Could have been a very dramatic shot if the sun was coming up behind the building.  Nice picture though.', '2007-05-17 21:09:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3661505, 512689, 12998, '<td valign="top">Lens flare and grass clippings are destracting.</td>', 'Lens flare and grass clippings are destracting.', '2007-05-17 21:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3661507, 511738, 12998, '<td valign="top">Could have been much more dramatic later in the evening when the lights of the pier came on.</td>', 'Could have been much more dramatic later in the evening when the lights of the pier came on.', '2007-05-17 21:13:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3661513, 510898, 78115, '<td valign="top">Hi new to site ,like pic ,great shot.</td>', 'Hi new to site ,like pic ,great shot.', '2007-05-17 21:14:25.000000', NULL, 1),
