(3662453, 511920, 6999, '<td valign="top">Despite the slightly small size, I suspect you''ll do quite well. Simplicity of composition works very well here. For me, it''s a bit too obvious an entry for this - the lamppost giving just enough to balance the receding arches; but I find nothing here more than the recession and that post - no intrigue of composition, no human interaction.</td>', 'Despite the slightly small size, I suspect you''ll do quite well. Simplicity of composition works very well here. For me, it''s a bit too obvious an entry for this - the lamppost giving just enough to balance the receding arches; but I find nothing here more than the recession and that post - no intrigue of composition, no human interaction.', '2007-05-18 05:27:58.000000', NULL, 1),
