(3665162, 512558, 77343, '<td valign="top">cool dof effect. i think if the foreground was in focus, it would be a better picture. i know you know this, but try a bigger aperture and see if there is a difference. cool pic nonetheless</td>', 'cool dof effect. i think if the foreground was in focus, it would be a better picture. i know you know this, but try a bigger aperture and see if there is a difference. cool pic nonetheless', '2007-05-19 00:25:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3665168, 511474, 77343, '<td valign="top">cool dof</td>', 'cool dof', '2007-05-19 00:27:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3665499, 510324, 42013, '<td valign="top">Not sure about the grain. The pastel colors are nice but i''d like to see the green desaturated to match.</td>', 'Not sure about the grain. The pastel colors are nice but i''d like to see the green desaturated to match.', '2007-05-19 03:12:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3665500, 510632, 42013, '<td valign="top">A brave soul, I predict you recieve a comment from posthumous ;)</td>', 'A brave soul, I predict you recieve a comment from posthumous ;)', '2007-05-19 03:12:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3665502, 511723, 42013, '<td valign="top">Very good, it is enticing in its softness and muted palette. faved</td>', 'Very good, it is enticing in its softness and muted palette. faved', '2007-05-19 03:12:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3665528, 510756, 42013, '<td valign="top">in all ways interesting 9</td>', 'in all ways interesting 9', '2007-05-19 03:39:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3665537, 510197, 42013, '<td valign="top">Very nice processing. Good luck</td>', 'Very nice processing. Good luck', '2007-05-19 03:53:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3665562, 512482, 6999, '<td valign="top">After a moment or two, this develops a feeling of floating free in space. The only thing I might suggest is that the stuff visible through the fence image right might have been cropped out: in such a pure composition even the most minor distractions can be important. It has an almost unworldly feeling.</td>', 'After a moment or two, this develops a feeling of floating free in space. The only thing I might suggest is that the stuff visible through the fence image right might have been cropped out: in such a pure composition even the most minor distractions can be important. It has an almost unworldly feeling.', '2007-05-19 04:39:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3665564, 512485, 6999, '<td valign="top">You could usefully have brought the black point up in this - the lack of it gives it a washed-out feeling. Perhaps this is too obvious a subject, with little to bring it out from the mass of other similar images.</td>', 'You could usefully have brought the black point up in this - the lack of it gives it a washed-out feeling. Perhaps this is too obvious a subject, with little to bring it out from the mass of other similar images.', '2007-05-19 04:42:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3665567, 512696, 6999, '<td valign="top">Some human interest at last. I find it hard to resolve the details that I want to see in this - size has some part to play in that, as you haven''t used the full dimensions available. I also wonder if you''d balanced your vanishing point and your figure with more consideration for their place in the frame it might be a more fulfilling image to view.</td>', 'Some human interest at last. I find it hard to resolve the details that I want to see in this - size has some part to play in that, as you haven''t used the full dimensions available. I also wonder if you''d balanced your vanishing point and your figure with more consideration for their place in the frame it might be a more fulfilling image to view.', '2007-05-19 04:48:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3665569, 512842, 6999, '<td valign="top">One of the more interesting approaches I''ve seen - I really rather like the geometry of it. It begs a study of the shapes and textures within that grass, and the slight oddness of the drain cover and those building on the horizon. Printed really big, it might almost be a Gursky.</td>', 'One of the more interesting approaches I''ve seen - I really rather like the geometry of it. It begs a study of the shapes and textures within that grass, and the slight oddness of the drain cover and those building on the horizon. Printed really big, it might almost be a Gursky.', '2007-05-19 04:51:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3665585, 510019, 75440, '<td valign="top">slick but rigid. nice.</td>', 'slick but rigid. nice.', '2007-05-19 05:34:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3665586, 512653, 75440, '<td valign="top">lightly glowing.</td>', 'lightly glowing.', '2007-05-19 05:35:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3665589, 511752, 75440, '<td valign="top">simplicity with power of nature.</td>', 'simplicity with power of nature.', '2007-05-19 05:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3665816, 512887, 78196, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but desperately needs a better camera - look at the fringing!</td>', 'Nice idea, but desperately needs a better camera - look at the fringing!', '2007-05-19 09:05:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3665817, 511244, 78196, '<td valign="top">Great shot, love the clouds.</td>', 'Great shot, love the clouds.', '2007-05-19 09:11:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3665822, 511817, 78196, '<td valign="top">Clever, clever stuff - the first photo I''ve seen that really gets to the heart of the challenge.</td>', 'Clever, clever stuff - the first photo I''ve seen that really gets to the heart of the challenge.', '2007-05-19 09:15:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3665868, 510632, 42792, '<td valign="top">I totally love the emptiness more than the vastness that jumps right out of the image here.  It''s that very tiny and lone figure that draws one in.  Almost disturbing and very surreal.  Don''t know if that was the point of this photo but it''s kept me fixated and to say the least, far from indifferent.  I''m glad to see an image like this in DPC - instant 10 from me and good luck!!!</td>', 'I totally love the emptiness more than the vastness that jumps right out of the image here.  It''s that very tiny and lone figure that draws one in.  Almost disturbing and very surreal.  Don''t know if that was the point of this photo but it''s kept me fixated and to say the least, far from indifferent.  I''m glad to see an image like this in DPC - instant 10 from me and good luck!!!', '2007-05-19 09:59:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3665881, 510486, 42792, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective but needs a little bit of tilt to straighten it up towards the left.  I like the processing tho''.</td>', 'Interesting perspective but needs a little bit of tilt to straighten it up towards the left.  I like the processing tho''.', '2007-05-19 10:07:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3665883, 512813, 30049, '<td valign="top">What vibrant color!  A very unique take on the challenge that I find quite interesting.  Lighting may be a tad hot on the left flower petal, but still a very nice photo.  Well done!  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'What vibrant color!  A very unique take on the challenge that I find quite interesting.  Lighting may be a tad hot on the left flower petal, but still a very nice photo.  Well done!  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-05-19 10:08:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3665884, 512360, 42792, '<td valign="top">Dynamic leading line and tilt but not quite sure about the reason for the de-sat. Don''t think it added anything.</td>', 'Dynamic leading line and tilt but not quite sure about the reason for the de-sat. Don''t think it added anything.', '2007-05-19 10:08:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3665890, 511481, 42792, '<td valign="top">Promising composition but needs work on the focus.  Seems soft all round and a little over-exposed.</td>', 'Promising composition but needs work on the focus.  Seems soft all round and a little over-exposed.', '2007-05-19 10:10:57.000000', NULL, 1);
