(3668392, 512206, 78736, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to see them in a more "open" picture... less trees. It would have been nice to actually "see" them disappear at the horizon instead of behind the trees.</td>', 'I would have liked to see them in a more "open" picture... less trees. It would have been nice to actually "see" them disappear at the horizon instead of behind the trees.', '2007-05-20 08:01:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3668394, 510347, 78736, '<td valign="top">It needs more converging lines</td>', 'It needs more converging lines', '2007-05-20 08:04:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3668397, 511791, 78736, '<td valign="top">Straight to the... point! Nice composition. I normally prefer color to B/W but this one spelled B/W. Love it even thought the railroads are the overdone converging lines subject. ;)</td>', 'Straight to the... point! Nice composition. I normally prefer color to B/W but this one spelled B/W. Love it even thought the railroads are the overdone converging lines subject. ;)', '2007-05-20 08:09:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3668399, 512815, 78736, '<td valign="top">Nice use of the tracks! Tracks are overdone converging lines subject but yours makes a really nice, and different use of them.</td>', 'Nice use of the tracks! Tracks are overdone converging lines subject but yours makes a really nice, and different use of them.', '2007-05-20 08:11:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3668407, 511213, 78736, '<td valign="top">I like the concept. But would have loved to see the pen held with the broken tip still in it. You could have used the pencil to get another diagonal line going north-west. But again, nice concept.</td>', 'I like the concept. But would have loved to see the pen held with the broken tip still in it. You could have used the pencil to get another diagonal line going north-west. But again, nice concept.', '2007-05-20 08:18:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3668412, 510413, 78736, '<td valign="top">The tilted horizon is just not tilted enough... either tilt it more or don''t tilt at all... takes away from the pic. Also, dead center horizon... would have liked to see more sky, it looks nice and threatening.</td>', 'The tilted horizon is just not tilted enough... either tilt it more or don''t tilt at all... takes away from the pic. Also, dead center horizon... would have liked to see more sky, it looks nice and threatening.', '2007-05-20 08:26:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3668420, 510698, 78736, '<td valign="top">I love this one! Love the big lines/small lines combination... even the crack goes towards the "vanishing point"... great composition and good choice on the B/W.</td>', 'I love this one! Love the big lines/small lines combination... even the crack goes towards the "vanishing point"... great composition and good choice on the B/W.', '2007-05-20 08:31:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3668423, 510324, 78736, '<td valign="top">Nah... concept is nice, but what happened to the pixels??? I can''t even distinguish the leaves...</td>', 'Nah... concept is nice, but what happened to the pixels??? I can''t even distinguish the leaves...', '2007-05-20 08:34:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3668424, 510882, 78736, '<td valign="top">Like it! Good choice of location on the bridge... maybe a little further could have gotten rid of the horizon on the right, leaving only the bridge to... really Nowhere! But I like.</td>', 'Like it! Good choice of location on the bridge... maybe a little further could have gotten rid of the horizon on the right, leaving only the bridge to... really Nowhere! But I like.', '2007-05-20 08:36:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3668425, 512661, 78736, '<td valign="top">This one needs a little more stuff in the bottom half... if you would have composed this from a little higher, you would have gotten more stuff down there and even more converging lines.</td>', 'This one needs a little more stuff in the bottom half... if you would have composed this from a little higher, you would have gotten more stuff down there and even more converging lines.', '2007-05-20 08:39:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3668430, 510592, 78736, '<td valign="top">nice scenery... but you got too much converging lines. I would have stuck with either the rails or the mountain lines converging at middle-left.</td>', 'nice scenery... but you got too much converging lines. I would have stuck with either the rails or the mountain lines converging at middle-left.', '2007-05-20 08:41:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3668440, 510322, 78736, '<td valign="top">Really nice! Would have gotten rid of the bottom-left background but other than that, really nice one!</td>', 'Really nice! Would have gotten rid of the bottom-left background but other than that, really nice one!', '2007-05-20 08:44:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3668446, 512354, 78736, '<td valign="top">really love the use of the building''s special architecture. Would have gotten rid of the trees'' reflection.</td>', 'really love the use of the building''s special architecture. Would have gotten rid of the trees'' reflection.', '2007-05-20 08:49:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3668450, 510238, 78736, '<td valign="top">Love the double use of the converging lines and the fog... Lucky timing or is there always fog there?</td>', 'Love the double use of the converging lines and the fog... Lucky timing or is there always fog there?', '2007-05-20 08:51:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3668459, 512442, 78736, '<td valign="top">Nice. Just nice!</td>', 'Nice. Just nice!', '2007-05-20 08:56:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3668462, 512487, 78736, '<td valign="top">I like the glowing effect of the lights at the end of the street, and the composition. How many shots did you take to get this one ;)?</td>', 'I like the glowing effect of the lights at the end of the street, and the composition. How many shots did you take to get this one ;)?', '2007-05-20 08:58:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3668483, 512497, 78736, '<td valign="top">Picture way too small... we can''t see nothing! Could have been nice... ;)</td>', 'Picture way too small... we can''t see nothing! Could have been nice... ;)', '2007-05-20 09:12:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3668489, 510227, 78736, '<td valign="top">Really like the use of the rails. The details in the wheel is really adding to this picture. Nice work!</td>', 'Really like the use of the rails. The details in the wheel is really adding to this picture. Nice work!', '2007-05-20 09:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3668501, 512446, 78736, '<td valign="top">Good choice of lens, the buildings colors and lines really augment the convergence of this picture. The street alone wouldn''t have made such a strong impact.</td>', 'Good choice of lens, the buildings colors and lines really augment the convergence of this picture. The street alone wouldn''t have made such a strong impact.', '2007-05-20 09:21:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3668527, 510775, 78736, '<td valign="top">Great composition, very thorough placement of the other pillars. The clouds are just visible enough not to crowd the picture. Love it.</td>', 'Great composition, very thorough placement of the other pillars. The clouds are just visible enough not to crowd the picture. Love it.', '2007-05-20 09:35:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3668545, 512578, 78736, '<td valign="top">Picture was taken way too low... the lines don''t converge enough... it''s more of a vanishing "line" than a vanishing point kinda picture.</td>', 'Picture was taken way too low... the lines don''t converge enough... it''s more of a vanishing "line" than a vanishing point kinda picture.', '2007-05-20 09:46:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3668567, 510517, 78736, '<td valign="top">Almost! The right lens, but the road horizon line would have looked better if exaclty straight, it''s just curved enough to make the viewer look at it instead of the lines.</td>', 'Almost! The right lens, but the road horizon line would have looked better if exaclty straight, it''s just curved enough to make the viewer look at it instead of the lines.', '2007-05-20 09:54:01.000000', NULL, 1);
