(3670494, 511244, 39531, '<td valign="top">Nicely done</td>', 'Nicely done', '2007-05-20 21:02:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3670743, 511272, 73894, '<td valign="top">Great capture. You can feel the action! Your either a real thrill seeker or a hobo with a dig ;) I notice a bit of chromatic aberration.Check your lens. Check out the open source image editing program called "gimp". You will love it.</td>', 'Great capture. You can feel the action! Your either a real thrill seeker or a hobo with a dig ;) I notice a bit of chromatic aberration.Check your lens. Check out the open source image editing program called "gimp". You will love it.', '2007-05-20 22:08:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3670760, 512256, 73894, '<td valign="top">nice. I''m guessing it was safe. My wife and I are expecting a girl. This scares me a bit. No penalty.7</td>', 'nice. I''m guessing it was safe. My wife and I are expecting a girl. This scares me a bit. No penalty.7', '2007-05-20 22:11:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3670775, 512746, 73894, '<td valign="top">Subject is great. Nice overall capture of the capital. However the vanishing point is not demonstrated well.5</td>', 'Subject is great. Nice overall capture of the capital. However the vanishing point is not demonstrated well.5', '2007-05-20 22:14:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3670781, 510641, 73894, '<td valign="top">ok 8</td>', 'ok 8', '2007-05-20 22:15:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3670819, 512640, 73894, '<td valign="top">Nice capture. Extremely dramatic mood. A VP is an optical effect of parallel lines.The rays in this image originate from the same relative point(the sun). 6</td>', 'Nice capture. Extremely dramatic mood. A VP is an optical effect of parallel lines.The rays in this image originate from the same relative point(the sun). 6', '2007-05-20 22:21:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3670971, 512781, 58610, '<td valign="top">This looks like the marina in Eureka, Ca.</td>', 'This looks like the marina in Eureka, Ca.', '2007-05-20 22:51:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3671186, 512901, 54431, '<td valign="top">Great composition and nice contrast. This works well in b/w. It''s interesting seeing the name "Molly" in the corner! I like how you decided to use it as the title.</td>', 'Great composition and nice contrast. This works well in b/w. It''s interesting seeing the name "Molly" in the corner! I like how you decided to use it as the title.', '2007-05-20 23:19:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3671370, 512503, 22734, '<td valign="top">Nice work.</td>', 'Nice work.', '2007-05-20 23:46:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3671420, 510919, 22734, '<td valign="top">A most interesting study!</td>', 'A most interesting study!', '2007-05-20 23:52:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3671437, 512522, 22734, '<td valign="top">Highly interesting with fascinating tonal strength and texture. 7 on first pass.</td>', 'Highly interesting with fascinating tonal strength and texture. 7 on first pass.', '2007-05-20 23:54:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3671445, 511157, 22734, '<td valign="top">Image of great spiritual strength.</td>', 'Image of great spiritual strength.', '2007-05-20 23:55:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3671456, 512770, 22734, '<td valign="top">Very interesting!</td>', 'Very interesting!', '2007-05-20 23:57:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3672638, 510821, 18870, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot. i''m giving it a 9 instead of a 10 only because i think it would have been much cleaner without the model.  but that''s just my opinion.  it''s still a great composition.</td>', 'I really like this shot. i''m giving it a 9 instead of a 10 only because i think it would have been much cleaner without the model.  but that''s just my opinion.  it''s still a great composition.', '2007-05-21 03:18:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3672849, 510745, 78778, '<td valign="top">Nice, the black and white sets it off.</td>', 'Nice, the black and white sets it off.', '2007-05-21 05:34:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3673454, 512388, 30049, '<td valign="top">I know this is somewhat of a cliche vanishing point image, but you took it to another level with the repeating sky/cloud patterns.  Wonderfully seen and captured!  Cute title too.  :)  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I know this is somewhat of a cliche vanishing point image, but you took it to another level with the repeating sky/cloud patterns.  Wonderfully seen and captured!  Cute title too.  :)  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-05-21 10:06:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3673478, 511723, 30049, '<td valign="top">I''m a sucker for beach fence photos.  :)  Personally, I like this.  The fence is probably more technically considered a leading line, but eh, I''m not sweating it.  Did you fret about the lamp post at the end?  Oops!  Almost wondered whether you considered cloning it out, but this challenge is running under basic rules...nevermind.  :P  Actually, the lamp post, for me, works as a stop point.  Helps keep me within the image.  The sepia tone works well for the mood and emotive feel of a lonely beach on a cloudy day.<br/> <br/>Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'I''m a sucker for beach fence photos.  :)  Personally, I like this.  The fence is probably more technically considered a leading line, but eh, I''m not sweating it.  Did you fret about the lamp post at the end?  Oops!  Almost wondered whether you considered cloning it out, but this challenge is running under basic rules...nevermind.  :P  Actually, the lamp post, for me, works as a stop point.  Helps keep me within the image.  The sepia tone works well for the mood and emotive feel of a lonely beach on a cloudy day. Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2007-05-21 10:11:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3673517, 510756, 53548, '<td valign="top">nice stuff. will do well in challenge i think.</td>', 'nice stuff. will do well in challenge i think.', '2007-05-21 10:19:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3673527, 510512, 53548, '<td valign="top">nice stuff. looks like hes walking a thin line. very good work with contrasts as well</td>', 'nice stuff. looks like hes walking a thin line. very good work with contrasts as well', '2007-05-21 10:20:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3673535, 511983, 53548, '<td valign="top">beutiful rays of light. fits the format just right</td>', 'beutiful rays of light. fits the format just right', '2007-05-21 10:21:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3673541, 512485, 53548, '<td valign="top">to few tonal variations, and the photo lacks interest\mood</td>', 'to few tonal variations, and the photo lacks interest\mood', '2007-05-21 10:23:19.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3674001, 512638, 78787, '<td valign="top">Nice lines</td>', 'Nice lines', '2007-05-21 11:51:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3674240, 510698, 30049, '<td valign="top">I can''t wait to see the comments you''ve rec''d on this one.  :)  Very creative vanishing point illusion created here.  Great eye to see and capture it, thick skin and courage to enter it.  It''s a little OOB for me personally but I like the direction you''ve taken and this photo has found it''s way near the top of my voting results for this challenge.  I voted several days ago, so sorry - you won''t see a jump after this comment.  :D<br/> <br/>Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'I can''t wait to see the comments you''ve rec''d on this one.  :)  Very creative vanishing point illusion created here.  Great eye to see and capture it, thick skin and courage to enter it.  It''s a little OOB for me personally but I like the direction you''ve taken and this photo has found it''s way near the top of my voting results for this challenge.  I voted several days ago, so sorry - you won''t see a jump after this comment.  :D Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2007-05-21 12:33:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3674252, 512411, 30049, '<td valign="top">The question I have is how in the world did you get in position to take this shot?!  I love the perspective and unique context of this photo for this challenge.  Well done!</td>', 'The question I have is how in the world did you get in position to take this shot?!  I love the perspective and unique context of this photo for this challenge.  Well done!', '2007-05-21 12:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3674284, 511213, 30049, '<td valign="top">Clever.  Certainly unique!  I''ll be interested in seeing how this shot does for you, AND I look forward to reading the comments.  :P<br/> <br/>Vanishing Point can be factored two ways here IMO, the vanishing point of the pencil as it lays broken and worn out on the drawing surface, and of course the converging parallel lines.  I think in the second case the point could have been illustrated better with the converging lines going a bit closer to the edge of the composition.  The DOF helps to diminish or blur the end point, but not quite enough.<br/> <br/>Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Clever.  Certainly unique!  I''ll be interested in seeing how this shot does for you, AND I look forward to reading the comments.  :P Vanishing Point can be factored two ways here IMO, the vanishing point of the pencil as it lays broken and worn out on the drawing surface, and of course the converging parallel lines.  I think in the second case the point could have been illustrated better with the converging lines going a bit closer to the edge of the composition.  The DOF helps to diminish or blur the end point, but not quite enough. Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-05-21 12:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3674306, 510632, 78383, '<td valign="top">i dont see a vanishing point.. nice interpretation though</td>', 'i dont see a vanishing point.. nice interpretation though', '2007-05-21 12:44:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3674484, 510197, 68256, '<td valign="top">I really like your processing, great grain! I''m picturing this photo without the grain (texture in the road and sky) and it isn''t nearly as effective as what you have presented.  I hope voters reward you for this beautiful processing.  9</td>', 'I really like your processing, great grain! I''m picturing this photo without the grain (texture in the road and sky) and it isn''t nearly as effective as what you have presented.  I hope voters reward you for this beautiful processing.  9', '2007-05-21 13:13:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3674510, 510106, 68256, '<td valign="top">I love this photo.  The blown out sky works so well and you have used it so effectively!  I kinda wish the air conditioners were not there, and the trees so that the composition would have been simpler, but I''m not voteing down for it. I think you have captured this scene so well and used what you had that I''m going to give you a 10.</td>', 'I love this photo.  The blown out sky works so well and you have used it so effectively!  I kinda wish the air conditioners were not there, and the trees so that the composition would have been simpler, but I''m not voteing down for it. I think you have captured this scene so well and used what you had that I''m going to give you a 10.', '2007-05-21 13:17:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3674530, 510745, 68256, '<td valign="top">I''m going back and bumping scores and making a few comments.  This is a very nice composition and is so well balanced!  I wished it was even more simple actually.  You''ve done well with what you had though.  8</td>', 'I''m going back and bumping scores and making a few comments.  This is a very nice composition and is so well balanced!  I wished it was even more simple actually.  You''ve done well with what you had though.  8', '2007-05-21 13:20:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3674544, 510978, 68256, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition and exposure!  I love the way the bright greens keep your eyes "on track".  Great job working that light and exposing perfectly.  Bumping up to a 10.</td>', 'Beautiful composition and exposure!  I love the way the bright greens keep your eyes "on track".  Great job working that light and exposing perfectly.  Bumping up to a 10.', '2007-05-21 13:22:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3674578, 510592, 59194, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  I find the rail offset distracting but I''m bumping the score down b/c of it.</td>', 'Great shot.  I find the rail offset distracting but I''m bumping the score down b/c of it.', '2007-05-21 13:28:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3674590, 512521, 59194, '<td valign="top">I like how not only do the posts begin to vanish but the seagulls as well.  I would suggest bumping the contrast a little or saturate the buildings or the blue sky a little more - something to grab the viewer more.</td>', 'I like how not only do the posts begin to vanish but the seagulls as well.  I would suggest bumping the contrast a little or saturate the buildings or the blue sky a little more - something to grab the viewer more.', '2007-05-21 13:30:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3674594, 510698, 59194, '<td valign="top">Nice B&amp;W shot.  I find the title a little distracting though.</td>', 'Nice B&W shot.  I find the title a little distracting though.', '2007-05-21 13:31:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3674616, 512813, 59194, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo but not a vanishing point.</td>', 'Beautiful photo but not a vanishing point.', '2007-05-21 13:36:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3674625, 512663, 59194, '<td valign="top">Definitely a vanishing point but I don''t find much in the photo to hold my interest.</td>', 'Definitely a vanishing point but I don''t find much in the photo to hold my interest.', '2007-05-21 13:37:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3674657, 511481, 59194, '<td valign="top">Nice but too blurry...</td>', 'Nice but too blurry...', '2007-05-21 13:42:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3674661, 512503, 59194, '<td valign="top">Yes...I''ve seen this place before :)</td>', 'Yes...I''ve seen this place before :)', '2007-05-21 13:43:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3674671, 512388, 59194, '<td valign="top">Awesome reflections.  I wouldn''t change a thing.</td>', 'Awesome reflections.  I wouldn''t change a thing.', '2007-05-21 13:45:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3674674, 511671, 59194, '<td valign="top">Great perspective and colors.  I really like the foreground details.</td>', 'Great perspective and colors.  I really like the foreground details.', '2007-05-21 13:46:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3674681, 510756, 59194, '<td valign="top">Very emotive</td>', 'Very emotive', '2007-05-21 13:48:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3674743, 510947, 59194, '<td valign="top">One of the better rail shots IMO.  I like the color and texture of the ballast (rocks).</td>', 'One of the better rail shots IMO.  I like the color and texture of the ballast (rocks).', '2007-05-21 14:00:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3675041, 511025, 30049, '<td valign="top">He-he.  These kind of shots are fun aren''t they.  :)  Last time I was out taking shots like this I felt like the looney dude with a camera - it was in a very public park.  :P<br/> <br/>I like your approach to this challenge.  It''s unique and interesting.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'He-he.  These kind of shots are fun aren''t they.  :)  Last time I was out taking shots like this I felt like the looney dude with a camera - it was in a very public park.  :P I like your approach to this challenge.  It''s unique and interesting.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-05-21 14:54:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3675050, 511188, 30049, '<td valign="top">The foreground framing adds interest.  The vanishing point is unfortunately obscurred by the people on the sidewalk.  Great idea.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'The foreground framing adds interest.  The vanishing point is unfortunately obscurred by the people on the sidewalk.  Great idea.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-05-21 14:56:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3675054, 510227, 59194, '<td valign="top">I love the up-close details but I wish the rails were a little more visible to get a little more vanishing.  Nice shot.</td>', 'I love the up-close details but I wish the rails were a little more visible to get a little more vanishing.  Nice shot.', '2007-05-21 14:57:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3675060, 511474, 30049, '<td valign="top">Good eye to see this, it''s quite unique.  I think if you had rotated this 90 left and put the vanishing point at the top you would be getting stronger results.  Nonetheless, I like it.  Well done.</td>', 'Good eye to see this, it''s quite unique.  I think if you had rotated this 90 left and put the vanishing point at the top you would be getting stronger results.  Nonetheless, I like it.  Well done.', '2007-05-21 14:58:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3675062, 512522, 59194, '<td valign="top">Awesome low perspective and sun rays from the right.  Hands down the best rail shot I''ve seen yet.</td>', 'Awesome low perspective and sun rays from the right.  Hands down the best rail shot I''ve seen yet.', '2007-05-21 14:59:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3675074, 512661, 30049, '<td valign="top">Ok idea.  The vanishing point doesn''t really get a chance to develop with the short lines generated by the guitar strings.  Perhaps if you''d gone in tighter to the neck?  Just a thought.  The lighting is very isolated.  Where you have strength in lighting it''s overexposed, yet the foreground and top areas are quite dark.  An artistic decision I suppose.<br/> <br/>Good luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'Ok idea.  The vanishing point doesn''t really get a chance to develop with the short lines generated by the guitar strings.  Perhaps if you''d gone in tighter to the neck?  Just a thought.  The lighting is very isolated.  Where you have strength in lighting it''s overexposed, yet the foreground and top areas are quite dark.  An artistic decision I suppose. Good luck to you in the challenge.', '2007-05-21 15:01:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3675081, 511474, 59194, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  So simple yet the textures and DOF hold my attention.</td>', 'Nice shot.  So simple yet the textures and DOF hold my attention.', '2007-05-21 15:03:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3675087, 511920, 59194, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity of this but I wish the colors weren''t so washed out.  The good lines and composition really help this great shot.</td>', 'I like the simplicity of this but I wish the colors weren''t so washed out.  The good lines and composition really help this great shot.', '2007-05-21 15:05:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3675100, 511738, 59194, '<td valign="top">Awesome.  I love the contrast and the lighting.  I wouldn''t change a thing.</td>', 'Awesome.  I love the contrast and the lighting.  I wouldn''t change a thing.', '2007-05-21 15:07:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3675122, 512557, 59194, '<td valign="top">Great texture and detail everywhere!</td>', 'Great texture and detail everywhere!', '2007-05-21 15:12:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3675492, 510019, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is a well-balanced, documentary type image.  What it''s missing IMO is some drama.  Some "Wow!".  For this subject I think you could have done a little more with lighting, perhaps something soft to pick up the shimmer on the strings, darker around the outside of the composition. A single light source out of view towards the far neck end.  ???  Just a thought.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is a well-balanced, documentary type image.  What it''s missing IMO is some drama.  Some "Wow!".  For this subject I think you could have done a little more with lighting, perhaps something soft to pick up the shimmer on the strings, darker around the outside of the composition. A single light source out of view towards the far neck end.  ???  Just a thought.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-05-21 16:14:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3675507, 510978, 30049, '<td valign="top">Lovely image.  I like the use of light and shadow here.  Not sure yet if I like the girl in the photo, or positioned where she is.  Right now I feel like she stops the viewer from following the fence and discovering the vanishing point.  Otherwise, it is a very well captured photo.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'Lovely image.  I like the use of light and shadow here.  Not sure yet if I like the girl in the photo, or positioned where she is.  Right now I feel like she stops the viewer from following the fence and discovering the vanishing point.  Otherwise, it is a very well captured photo.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2007-05-21 16:18:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3675530, 511920, 29537, '<td valign="top">a good and elegant framing</td>', 'a good and elegant framing', '2007-05-21 16:22:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3675610, 512439, 30049, '<td valign="top">Hey look, it''s fake snow!  :)  That path looks like the canal trail in my area.  Great for rollerblading.  As for the photo, you''ve done a nice job with the vanishing point.  The IR is ok for some, not so much for others.  Personally I''m not a big fan of it.  Does make this photo stand out in the crowd for this challenge.  Hope that works out for you - good luck!</td>', 'Hey look, it''s fake snow!  :)  That path looks like the canal trail in my area.  Great for rollerblading.  As for the photo, you''ve done a nice job with the vanishing point.  The IR is ok for some, not so much for others.  Personally I''m not a big fan of it.  Does make this photo stand out in the crowd for this challenge.  Hope that works out for you - good luck!', '2007-05-21 16:39:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3675620, 512503, 30049, '<td valign="top">Yes, I''d say it is.  :)  This is a well done photo overall.  For vanishing point I''m not sure how well it works with you posed in the composition.  It kind of makes the viewer stop and slow down to rest on the person, rather than continuing into the vanishing point.  JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Yes, I''d say it is.  :)  This is a well done photo overall.  For vanishing point I''m not sure how well it works with you posed in the composition.  It kind of makes the viewer stop and slow down to rest on the person, rather than continuing into the vanishing point.  JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-05-21 16:41:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3675651, 512422, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is creative.  I also like how the sky reflecting on the water adds to the image.  The reflection kind of works like a directional beacon. :)  Now, where''s my fishing pole!  :P  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is creative.  I also like how the sky reflecting on the water adds to the image.  The reflection kind of works like a directional beacon. :)  Now, where''s my fishing pole!  :P  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-05-21 16:45:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3675724, 512541, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, but seems quite busy for the subject ''Vanishing Point''.  I see a lot of lines (cool looking too I might add) but nothing that vanishes.  ???<br/> <br/>Sorry if I missed it.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Nice photo, but seems quite busy for the subject ''Vanishing Point''.  I see a lot of lines (cool looking too I might add) but nothing that vanishes.  ??? Sorry if I missed it.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-05-21 17:01:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3675736, 512789, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice repeating patterns and I like the color tones.  Looks like the top of the building kind of squelched the vanishing point(s)?  Needed a taller building.  :D  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Nice repeating patterns and I like the color tones.  Looks like the top of the building kind of squelched the vanishing point(s)?  Needed a taller building.  :D  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-05-21 17:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3675804, 512413, 78353, '<td valign="top">Amazing double concept....wonderful!!!!</td>', 'Amazing double concept....wonderful!!!!', '2007-05-21 17:20:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3675807, 512664, 78353, '<td valign="top">I love the fog...very nice photo</td>', 'I love the fog...very nice photo', '2007-05-21 17:21:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3675810, 511731, 78353, '<td valign="top">I am not really sure why, but I don''t like this photo...sorry</td>', 'I am not really sure why, but I don''t like this photo...sorry', '2007-05-21 17:22:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3675814, 511790, 78353, '<td valign="top">beautiful</td>', 'beautiful', '2007-05-21 17:23:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3675821, 510821, 78353, '<td valign="top">I love the fog and the brown tint...</td>', 'I love the fog and the brown tint...', '2007-05-21 17:23:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3675827, 512262, 78353, '<td valign="top">this is a nice photo, but I think it would be better taken from a further distance to decrease the size of the bridge at the "vanishing point"...</td>', 'this is a nice photo, but I think it would be better taken from a further distance to decrease the size of the bridge at the "vanishing point"...', '2007-05-21 17:24:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676451, 511170, 69684, '<td valign="top">I think "seven" here is a dream.</td>', 'I think "seven" here is a dream.', '2007-05-21 19:39:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676467, 510197, 69684, '<td valign="top">Think it''s just too grainy. Nice photo anyway.</td>', 'Think it''s just too grainy. Nice photo anyway.', '2007-05-21 19:44:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676494, 512842, 69684, '<td valign="top">I like the try, but I don''t think it works. The main subject (center part) is not vanishing.</td>', 'I like the try, but I don''t think it works. The main subject (center part) is not vanishing.', '2007-05-21 19:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676615, 510747, 78810, '<td valign="top">very nice, great shot! im sure i recognise that building... :) L&amp;G</td>', 'very nice, great shot! im sure i recognise that building... :) L&G', '2007-05-21 20:18:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676716, 512497, 6370, '<td valign="top">too small</td>', 'too small', '2007-05-21 20:49:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676727, 512470, 6370, '<td valign="top">love those yellows</td>', 'love those yellows', '2007-05-21 20:51:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676811, 511481, 76645, '<td valign="top">The entire image seems out of focus. This maybe as you have focused on the sky and then the foreground has become unsharp. Try if possible to use a higher aperture to get the entire image sharp. this shold be possible with this much light. Great idea though creating movement in the picture with the waves...</td>', 'The entire image seems out of focus. This maybe as you have focused on the sky and then the foreground has become unsharp. Try if possible to use a higher aperture to get the entire image sharp. this shold be possible with this much light. Great idea though creating movement in the picture with the waves...', '2007-05-21 21:10:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676837, 512781, 76645, '<td valign="top">This image seem a tan unsharp on the yellow boat infront which is also a bit distracting as you keep focusing on it instead of the walkway. This image would be great with no yellow boat a higher aperture and a tripod :)</td>', 'This image seem a tan unsharp on the yellow boat infront which is also a bit distracting as you keep focusing on it instead of the walkway. This image would be great with no yellow boat a higher aperture and a tripod :)', '2007-05-21 21:14:14.000000', NULL, 1),
