(3685226, 512789, 67697, '<td valign="top">Love how people take pleasure in typing out DNMC - as if to impart with you their depth of knowledge of photography in 4 letters.  <br/> <br/>(Oh maybe it means Desires Not to Make Comment - hmmmmm)<br/> <br/>I do love the lines and texures in this.  The color and focus is spectacular.  I think you probably got the infamous 4 letter comment because your point simply ends instead of vanishing.  (Let me know if you do not understand).  Otherwise, I hope you can find a way to use this building for another challenge - it''s a beautiful shot!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-05-23 09:42:26.</i></td>', 'Love how people take pleasure in typing out DNMC - as if to impart with you their depth of knowledge of photography in 4 letters.   (Oh maybe it means Desires Not to Make Comment - hmmmmm) I do love the lines and texures in this.  The color and focus is spectacular.  I think you probably got the infamous 4 letter comment because your point simply ends instead of vanishing.  (Let me know if you do not understand).  Otherwise, I hope you can find a way to use this building for another challenge - it''s a beautiful shot!', '2007-05-23 10:40:46.000000', '2007-05-23 10:42:26.000000', 0),
