(3686865, 510322, 61651, '<td valign="top">Beautiful perspective, great take on the challenge.<br/> <br/>Artist: Dire Straits<br/>Song Lyrics: Love Over Gold<br/> <br/>You walk out on the high wire<br/>You''re dancer on thin ice<br/>You pay no heed to the danger<br/>And less to advice<br/>Your footsteps are forbidden<br/>But with knowledge of your sin<br/>You throw your love to all the strangers<br/>And caution to the wind<br/> <br/>And you go dancing through doorways<br/>Just to see what you will find<br/>Leaving nothing to interfere<br/>With the crazy balance of your mind<br/><b>And when you finally reappear<br/>At the place where you came in</b> <br/>You''re thrown your love to all the strangers<br/>And caution to the wind<br/> <br/>I takes love over gold<br/>And mind over matter<br/>To do what you to that you must<br/>When the things that you hold<br/>Can fall and be shattered<br/>Or run through your fingers like dust</td>', 'Beautiful perspective, great take on the challenge. Artist: Dire StraitsSong Lyrics: Love Over Gold You walk out on the high wireYou''re dancer on thin iceYou pay no heed to the dangerAnd less to adviceYour footsteps are forbiddenBut with knowledge of your sinYou throw your love to all the strangersAnd caution to the wind And you go dancing through doorwaysJust to see what you will findLeaving nothing to interfereWith the crazy balance of your mindAnd when you finally reappearAt the place where you came in You''re thrown your love to all the strangersAnd caution to the wind I takes love over goldAnd mind over matterTo do what you to that you mustWhen the things that you holdCan fall and be shatteredOr run through your fingers like dust', '2007-05-23 15:35:03.000000', NULL, 0),
