(3690957, 512752, 30049, '<td valign="top">I totally missed the vanishing point in this during the challenge.  I kept looking to the farm on the left wondering if the fence was supposed to be the vanishing point and that didn''t really do it.  Then I wondered if there was some deeper philosophical point I was missing, like farms are vanishing, etc...<br/> <br/>Never looked INSIDE the bus for it.  Now I see it!  :D<br/> <br/>Too clever for your own good on this one Skip.  :P</td>', 'I totally missed the vanishing point in this during the challenge.  I kept looking to the farm on the left wondering if the fence was supposed to be the vanishing point and that didn''t really do it.  Then I wondered if there was some deeper philosophical point I was missing, like farms are vanishing, etc... Never looked INSIDE the bus for it.  Now I see it!  :D Too clever for your own good on this one Skip.  :P', '2007-05-24 13:20:03.000000', NULL, 0),
